        'Color tells the story. A green (or hollow) candle means the price closed higher than it opened, buyers won that period. A red (or filled) candle means the price closed lower than it opened, sellers dominated. The size of the body shows the strength of that move: a long green body means strong buying pressure, a long red body means heavy selling.',
